    "html": "<p>A thermally isolated container has <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> kg of ice. The specific latent heat of fusion of ice is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.336\"></span> MJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. How much energy must be supplied to the ice to completely melt it, without changing its temperature? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.0336\"></span> MJ</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.336\"></span> MJ</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.36\"></span> MJ</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"33.6\"></span> MJ</li>\n</ol>"
